#: ../../integration_guides/Networking/infoblox.rst:46
msgid ""
"Filter which networks are synced into |morpheus|. Example: Network "
"Filter: ``network_view=default&*Building=work``"
msgstr "Filtre quais redes são sincronizadas no |morpheus|. Exemplo: Network Filter: ``network_view=default&*Building=work``"

#: ../../integration_guides/Networking/infoblox.rst:47
msgid "ZONE FILTER"
msgstr "ZONE FILTER"

#: ../../integration_guides/Networking/infoblox.rst:48
